# Client-Side Monitoring for Web Mining.

**Authors:** Fenstermacher, Kurt D., Ginsburg, Mark

## Abstract
Discusses mining Web data to draw conclusions about Web users and proposes a client-side monitoring system that supports flexible data collection and encompasses client-side applications beyond the Web browser to incorporate standard office productivity tools. Highlights include goals for client-side monitoring; framework for user monitoring, including link mining; and future development. (Author/LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ671886

